            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Disable it only in terminal buffer. Like this:\r\n```lua\r\nlocal disable_indentscope = function(data) vim.b[data.buf].miniindentscope_disable = true end\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\r\n  'TermOpen',\r\n  { desc = \"Disable 'mini.indentscope' in terminal buffer\", callback = disable_indentscope }\r\n)\r\n```",
